// Dynamic lights on a brush model, for the real client on training: a held light the
// hand gun's muzzle flash colour and radius (fx\test_dlight.tik, copy it in first) over
// padfloor_target1, the pad that glows red for the distraction lesson, seen from a
// camera: a shot before the light, then the light 40 units over the pad's middle, just
// past its near edge, 100 units over it, and just inside its far edge, where the
// recess wall faces the camera. Quake III's projection straight down Z painted walls
// under the light as a band; retail projects along each vertex's normal.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 25
$padfloor_target1 shader waveamp 0.4
spawn Camera targetname cam1 origin "1400 720 160" angles "28 270 0"
wait 0.1
cuecamera $cam1
wait 1
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 3
spawn test_dlight.tik origin "1400 416 8" targetname dl1
wait 0.2
$dl1 anim idle
wait 1
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 3
$dl1 remove
spawn test_dlight.tik origin "1400 500 8" targetname dl2
wait 0.2
$dl2 anim idle
wait 1
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 3
$dl2 remove
spawn test_dlight.tik origin "1400 416 68" targetname dl3
wait 0.2
$dl3 anim idle
wait 1
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 3
$dl3 remove
spawn test_dlight.tik origin "1400 350 10" targetname dl4
wait 0.2
$dl4 anim idle
wait 1
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 3
stuffcmd "quit"
end
